## Starting EXWM

### Option A: From existing Emacs session

```elisp
M-x exwm-enable
```

### Option B: Create ~/.xinitrc

```bash
#!/bin/sh

# Load resources
xrdb -merge ~/.Xresources 2>/dev/null || true

# Start Emacs with EXWM
exec emacs
```

Make executable:
```bash
chmod +x ~/.xinitrc
```

Start:
```bash
startx
```

