## Quick Chrome Launcher

Add to your config:

```elisp
(defun launch-chrome ()
  "Launch Google Chrome/Chromium in EXWM."
  (interactive)
  (start-process "chrome" nil "chromium-browser"))

(global-set-key (kbd "C-c w c") 'launch-chrome)
```

Then use `C-c w c` to launch Chrome anytime.

