## Alternative: Simpler Options

If EXWM feels too complex:

### xwidget-webkit (Embedded Browser)

```elisp
M-x xwidget-webkit-browse-url
```

Requires Emacs compiled with `--with-xwidgets`.

### EWW (Text Browser)

```elisp
M-x eww
```

Built-in, works everywhere, text-only.

### EAF (Emacs Application Framework)

Lighter than EXWM, embeds Chromium as an Emacs buffer:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/emacs-eaf/emacs-application-framework ~/.emacs.d/eaf
```

